                        <div class="timeline-date">Aug 2026 — Present</div>
                        <div class="timeline-main"><h3>PhD Student</h3><p class="timeline-org">Washington State University <span>·</span> Pullman, Washington</p><p>Working on 2.5D and 3D chiplet-based systems, with broader interests in deep learning compilers, hardware-software co-design, and efficient machine learning across heterogeneous hardware.</p></div>
