                    <article class="timeline-item">
                        <div class="timeline-date">Aug 2025 — Jun 2026</div>
                        <div class="timeline-main"><h3>Research Assistant</h3><p class="timeline-org">BrainSeek Lab <span>·</span> IIT Madras</p><p>Developed MLIR/LLVM compiler pass pipelines to map sparse tensor operations to RISC-V vector extensions for Edge AI accelerators. The RICE compiler project was also presented at the AI for Bharat Summit.</p>
                            <div class="contributions"><h4>Selected contributions</h4><ul><li>Designed the RICE Dialect, a custom MLIR dialect for optimizing Transformer workloads on RISC-V.</li><li>Built an instruction-scheduled ViT inference pipeline tailored for RISC-V architectures.</li><li>Analyzed phase-ordering effects on code quality and reported 1.5–2× speedups over scalar baselines.</li></ul></div>
