                            <div class="contributions"><h4>Selected contributions</h4><ul><li>Achieved geometric-mean speedups of 17× over PyG and 6.5× over DGL on large-scale datasets.</li><li>Engineered a sparsity-aware execution engine to reduce memory traffic on irregular workloads.</li><li>Implemented CUDA and OpenMP kernels, plus an MPI distributed partitioner with non-blocking training.</li></ul></div>
