                    <figure class="project-art project-art-llvm"><img src="https://llvm.org/img/LLVMWyvernBig.png" alt="LLVM wyvern mark" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>LLVM · compiler infrastructure</figcaption></figure>
                    <div class="project-content"><div class="project-topline"><span>02 / ANALYSIS</span><span>C++ · LLVM</span></div>
                    <h3>LLVM compiler passes</h3>
                    <p>Compiler analyses for range and pointer information, dependence-based loop parallelization, and automatic array bounds checking.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/anubhavkhajuria" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
                </article>
                <article class="project-card">
                    <figure class="project-art project-art-quant" aria-label="Model compression from 11.4 megabytes to 1.56 megabytes"><div class="quant-compare"><span>FP32</span><i></i><b>7.3×</b><i></i><span>W4A8</span></div><figcaption>MobileNet V2 · 11.4 MB → 1.56 MB</figcaption></figure>
                    <div class="project-content"><div class="project-topline"><span>03 / EFFICIENT ML</span><span>PyTorch · W4A8</span></div>
                    <h3>MobileNet compression</h3>
                    <p>Pruning and post-training quantization reduced the model size 7.3×, with under 4% accuracy loss.</p>
                    <a class="project-link" href="https://github.com/anubhavkhajuria" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code on GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
